sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant C as Reports page
  participant A as Express API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>C: Choose period
  C->>A: GET /api/reports/summary?range=30
  A->>A: Check reports: read
  par Run in parallel
    A->>D: Sales and purchase totals
  and
    A->>D: Units, COGS, gross profit, uncosted revenue
  and
    A->>D: Top products, categories, top customers
  and
    A->>D: Daily or monthly trend
  and
    A->>D: Stock counts, stock value, low / out / expiring lists
  end
  D-->>A: Aggregates
  A->>A: Average order value, margin, potential profit
  A-->>C: Summary JSON
  C->>C: Fill trend gaps, draw cards, chart, tables
  U->>C: Click Low stock card
  C-->>U: List of low-stock products
